sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Graph as LangGraph Workflow
    participant Nodes as Workflow Nodes
    participant Saver as InMemorySaver Checkpointer

    Note over User,Saver: Turn 1: Initial Query (thread_id = T1)
    User->>Graph: invoke({"question": "What are onboarding steps?"}, thread_id=T1)
    Graph->>Saver: load_checkpoint(thread_id=T1)
    Saver-->>Graph: None (fresh thread)
    Graph->>Nodes: initialize_state (conversation_history=[])
    Nodes->>Nodes: retrieve -> validate -> generate
    Nodes->>Nodes: update_memory (append Turn 1)
    Nodes->>Graph: finalize
    Graph->>Saver: save_checkpoint(thread_id=T1, state={history: [Turn 1]})
    Graph-->>User: Return Answer + Sources

    Note over User,Saver: Turn 2: Contextual Follow-up (Same thread_id = T1)
    User->>Graph: invoke({"question": "What should I complete first?"}, thread_id=T1)
    Graph->>Saver: load_checkpoint(thread_id=T1)
    Saver-->>Graph: Restored State (history: [Turn 1])
    Graph->>Nodes: initialize_state (preserves existing history: [Turn 1])
    Nodes->>Nodes: retrieve_documents
    Nodes->>Nodes: validate_context
    opt Insufficient Context
        Nodes->>Nodes: refine_question_or_retrieve (uses Turn 1 context keyword 'onboarding')
        Nodes->>Nodes: retry retrieval
    end
    Nodes->>Nodes: generate_answer
    Nodes->>Nodes: update_memory (append Turn 2, total history=2)
    Nodes->>Graph: finalize
    Graph->>Saver: save_checkpoint(thread_id=T1, state={history: [Turn 1, Turn 2]})
    Graph-->>User: Return Follow-up Answer
